---
manual: styles.state.readonly
lines: [1417, 1420]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: G4
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 200 do
  @line = edit_line text: "fixed", state: "readonly"
end
----------- test code
line = edit_line("@line")
click_on line
assert_equal line.linkable_id, focused_drawable&.linkable_id, "a read-only edit_line is still active: it takes focus"

type_text "changed"
assert_equal "fixed", line.text, "but typing does not edit it"
